n a construct private pure subroutine stack_push (self, sc) Open construct sc , growing the storage as needed. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( scope_stack_t ), intent(inout) :: self the stack type( scope_t ), intent(in) :: sc the construct to open procedure, public :: restore => stack_restore replace the open constructs by saved ones private pure subroutine stack_restore (self, scopes) Replace the open constructs by scopes (outermost first). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( scope_stack_t ), intent(inout) :: self the stack type( scope_t ), intent(in) :: scopes (:) a saved stack (see stack_snapshot ) procedure, public :: snapshot => stack_snapshot the open constructs, to save private pure function stack_snapshot (self) result(scopes) The open constructs, outermost first. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( scope_stack_t ), intent(in) :: self the stack Return Value type( scope_t ), allocatable, (:) Source Code type :: scope_stack_t !! The open constructs, outermost first. type ( scope_t ), allocatable :: s (:) !! storage; only `s(1:top)` is in use integer :: top = 0 !! number of open constructs contains procedure :: push => stack_push !! open a construct procedure :: restore => stack_restore !! replace the open constructs by saved ones procedure :: snapshot => stack_snapshot !! the open constructs, to save end type scope_stack_t","tags":"","url":"type/scope_stack_t.html"},{"title":"scope_t – fformat ","text":"type, private :: scope_t An open construct on the scope stack. Inherited by type~~scope_t~~InheritedByGraph type~scope_t scope_t type~saved_stack_t saved_stack_t type~saved_stack_t->type~scope_t at_if, after_first type~scope_stack_t scope_stack_t type~scope_stack_t->type~scope_t s Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from 