& 'interface' , 'module' , 'procedure' , 'program' , 'select' , 'submodule' , 'subroutine' , & 'team' , & 'type' , 'where' ] integer :: k if ( len ( w ) > 3 . and . w ( 1 : min ( 3 , len ( w ))) == 'end' ) then do k = 1 , size ( ends ) if ( w ( 4 :) == trim ( ends ( k ))) then if ( w ( 4 :) == 'blockdata' ) then parts = [ string_t ( 'end' ), string_t ( 'block' ), string_t ( 'data' )] else parts = [ string_t ( 'end' ), string_t ( w ( 4 :))] end if return end if end do end if select case ( w ) case ( 'elseif' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'else' ), string_t ( 'if' )] case ( 'elsewhere' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'else' ), string_t ( 'where' )] case ( 'selectcase' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'select' ), string_t ( 'case' )] case ( 'selecttype' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'select' ), string_t ( 'type' )] case ( 'selectrank' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'select' ), string_t ( 'rank' )] case ( 'blockdata' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'block' ), string_t ( 'data' )] case ( 'changeteam' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'change' ), string_t ( 'team' )] case ( 'doubleprecision' ) parts = [ string_t ( 'double' ), string_t ( 'precision' )] case default parts = [ string_t ( w )] end select end function expand_keyword","tags":"","url":"proc/expand_keyword.html"},{"title":"set – fformat","text":"private pure subroutine set(info, role, construct) Set the role and construct of info . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( stmt_info_t ), intent(inout) :: info the classification to update integer, intent(in) :: role one of the ROLE_* constants integer, intent(in) :: construct one of the C_* constants Called by proc~~set~~CalledByGraph proc~set set proc~classify_statement classify_statement proc~classify_statement->proc~set proc~analyze_structure analyze_structure proc~analyze_structure->proc~classify_statement proc~format_pass format_pass proc~format_pass->proc~analyze_structure proc~format_text format_text proc~format_text->proc~format_pass proc~relayout relayout proc~format_text->proc~relayout proc~relayout->pr