=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte of the opening . Return Value integer private  function fypp_inline_end (src, i) result(j) Last byte of inline fypp ( ${...}$ , @{...}@ , #{...}# ) starting at i , or 0. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte to look at Return Value integer private elemental function is_blank (c) True for a blank or tab. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private elemental function is_code_char (c) A character that can be part of a code token (not a blank, line break or comment). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private elemental function is_digit (c) True for 0 to 9 . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private elemental function is_letter (c) True for an ASCII letter. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private elemental function is_name_char (c) Characters allowed after the first letter of a name ( $ is a common extension). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private  function is_preproc_start (src, i) True if a preprocessor line starts at i (the first non-blank of the line): cpp #... ,\nfypp #: , #! , $: and @: . Inline fypp #{ is not a directive line. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i first non-blank byte of the line Return Value logical private elemental function is_quote (c) True for ' or \" . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=1), intent(in) :: c the character Return Value logical private pure function last_nonblank (src, i, j) result(k) Last non-blank byte in src(i:j) , or 0. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte range to search integer, intent(in) :: j byte range to search Return Value integer private pure function line_end (src, i) result(j) Index of the last byte before the line break at or after i . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte to start from Return Value integer private  function name_end (src, i) result(j) Last byte of the name starting at i , stopping before inline fypp ${ . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i first byte of the name Return Value integer private pure function only_blanks_to_eol (src, i) True if there are only blanks from i to the end of the line. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte to start from Return Value logical private  function operator_end (src, i) result(j) Last byte of a two- or one-character operator at i , or 0 if there is none. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte to look at Return Value integer private pure function peek (src, i) Character at i , or NUL outside the string. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i byte index, possibly outside src Return Value character(len=1) private  function preproc_end (src, i) result(j) Last byte of a preprocessor line at i , including continuation lines: a trailing \\ for\ncpp, a trailing & for fypp. The final line break is not included. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: src source text integer, intent(in) :: i first byte of the directive ( # , $ or @ 