, DIR_OFF = 2 , DIR_ON = 3 !! none, `!&`, `!&<`, `!&>` contains function protected_items ( src , tokens , stmts ) result ( keep ) !! True for each item that must be written exactly as it is: statements with a `!&` comment, and !! everything from a `!&<` line to the next `!&>` line, both included. character ( len =* ), intent ( in ) :: src !! source text type ( token_list_t ), intent ( in ) :: tokens !! tokens of `src` type ( statement_list_t ), intent ( in ) :: stmts !! items of `tokens` logical , allocatable :: keep (:) logical :: off integer :: k , j , d allocate ( keep ( stmts % n )) off = . false . do k = 1 , stmts % n keep ( k ) = off do j = stmts % s ( k )% first , stmts % s ( k )% last if ( tokens % tok ( j )% kind /= TK_COMMENT ) cycle d = directive ( src , tokens % tok ( j )) if ( stmts % s ( k )% kind == SK_COMMENT . and . d == DIR_OFF ) then off = . true . keep ( k ) = . true . else if ( stmts % s ( k )% kind == SK_COMMENT . and . d == DIR_ON ) then off = . false . keep ( k ) = . true . else if ( stmts % s ( k )% kind == SK_CODE . and . d == DIR_KEEP ) then keep ( k ) = . true . end if end do end do end function protected_items integer function directive ( src , t ) !! Formatter directive (one of the DIR_* constants) of a comment token. character ( len =* ), intent ( in ) :: src !! source text type ( token_t ), intent ( in ) :: t !! a comment token of `src` character ( len = :), allocatable :: text integer :: n directive = DIR_NONE if ( t % sub /= CM_FORMATTER ) return text = token_text ( src , t ) n = len ( text ) do while ( n > 0 ) ! without trailing blanks and tabs if ( text ( n : n ) /= ' ' . and . text ( n : n ) /= achar ( 9 )) exit n = n - 1 end do text = text ( 1 : n ) if ( text == '!&<' ) then directive = DIR_OFF else if ( text == '!&>' ) then directive = DIR_ON else if ( len ( text ) == 2 ) then directive = DIR_KEEP else if ( text ( 3 : 3 ) == ' ' ) then directive = DIR_KEEP end if end function directive end module ffmt_directives","tags":"","url